      "title": "Qt: Do not crash on menu actions triggers",
      "message": "Qt: Do not crash on menu actions triggers\n\nWorkaround QTBUG-106718 by connecting Export Packet Bytes action and\nprofile import/export actions with QueuedConnection. Qt bug will be\nfixed in Qt 6.2.8, 6.4.3, 6.5.0 and 6.6.0. Qt 6.2 LTS releases (6.2.5\nand later) are available only for commercial license holders so we\nshould keep the workaround in the foreseeable future.\n",
      "author_name": "Tomasz Moń",
      "author_email": "desowin@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-02-26T13:41:16.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Tomasz Moń",
      "committer_email": "desowin@gmail.com",
